        - 'Tap or pinch with your right hand: Snap3D turns "A cute dog wearing a hat" into, from left to right, a preview image, a base mesh and a refined 3D model.'
        - "Tap or pinch with your right hand: Snap3D turns the image at the URL into a base mesh and a refined 3D model."
        - 'Tap or pinch: DeepSeek R1 answers "Is a hotdog a sandwich?" with a one-line reasoning and its final answer.'
        - "Tap or pinch: GPT answers on the left, GPT Image paints an image on the right and a voice reads a movie-trailer line."
        - "A realtime voice session opens with this step: talk and read the replies here, or ask it to change the text color."
        - "Tap or pinch: Gemini answers on the left, Imagen paints the image on the right and Lyria plays a short music track."
        - "A Gemini Live session opens with this step: talk and read the replies here, or ask it to change the text color."
