  Text: |-
    Remote Service Gateway connects this Lens to hosted AI services: Snap3D, DeepSeek, OpenAI, Gemini, Imagen and Lyria.
    
    The Lens needs a Remote Service Gateway token. Without one, every example answers with an error instead of a result.
    
    Use Previous / Next to pick an example, then tap or pinch with your right hand to run it.
